OL,3,AHundreds remember synagogue attack
OL,4,Avictims
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Chief Rabbi Ephraim Mirvis and
OL,7,FCommunities Secretary Angela Rayner are
OL,8,Famong about 800 people attending a
OL,9,Fmemorial event for the victims and
OL,10,Fsurvivors of last year's Heaton Park
OL,11,Fsynagogue attack.
OL,13,FMelvin Cravitz and Adrian Daulby were
OL,14,Fkilled, and three others injured, as
OL,15,Fthey tried to defend their place of
OL,16,Fworship from attacker Jihad al-Shamie
OL,17,Fon 2 October 2025.
OL,19,FA service of remembrance began at the
OL,20,Fsynagogue in Manchester at 20:00 BST,
OL,21,Fwith relatives of the bereaved and some
OL,22,Fof the survivors among the speakers.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
